{"reference":"2 Samuel 19","book":"2 Samuel","chapter":19,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"In the Story of 2 Samuel","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Second Samuel traces David’s rise and the consolidation of his kingdom, then moves through the ark and the promise concerning his dynasty into royal abuse, violence within his household, rebellion, and grief. Chapter 19 stands within this latter movement: David’s mourning for Absalom and his return to public rule unfold amid the continuing strain on his household and kingdom.","verse_refs":["2 Samuel 1","2 Samuel 10:1-19","2 Samuel 11:1-27","2 Samuel 12:1-31","2 Samuel 13:1-39","2 Samuel 14:1-33","2 Samuel 15:1-37","2 Samuel 16:1-23","2 Samuel 17:1-29","2 Samuel 18:1-33","2 Samuel 20:1-26","2 Samuel 21:1-22","2 Samuel 22:1-51","2 Samuel 23:1-39","2 Samuel 24:1-25","2 Samuel 2:1-32","2 Samuel 3:1-39","2 Samuel 4:1-12","2 Samuel 5:1-25","2 Samuel 6:1-23","2 Samuel 7:1-29","2 Samuel 8:1-18","2 Samuel 9:1-13"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_2_samuel_019_36da80a60b9d1fc4079f0ea5"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"fact"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}